{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はFNS歌謡祭でしたヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"史上初のアイドルコラボメドレーヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こういうものに乃木坂46も参加出来て凄く嬉しかった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"AKBさんと会いたかったを歌わせて頂いたのですが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"デビューシングルのぐるぐるカーテンのカップリングで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会いたかったかもしれない"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とちょっとタイトルと曲調をアレンジして歌っていたあの時。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今同じステージで歌っていたんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"凄い事だなって震えました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりに制服のマネキンもテレビで歌いました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかも、欅坂46生放送初お披露目しましたヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2015/12/16/7518926/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"平手ちゃんよく頑張りましたよしよし"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2015/12/16/7518926/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"AKB48に兼任した時先輩を知り、松井玲奈さんも乃木坂46に沢山教えて下さいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二期生とはまた違う妹分。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもよろしくねヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、ヘビロテでペアで歌った私立恵比寿中学は柏木ひなたちゃんとヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2015/12/16/7518926/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きゃわわ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2015/12/16/7518926/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒ちゃんを推しメンって言ってくれたよ(´；ω；｀)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2015/12/16/7518926/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お友達になりましたヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また一緒にパフォーマンスしたいなぁヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は色んな方とお友達になりましたヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日以降もオフショット載せていきますね〜ヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2015/12/16/7518926/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まゆゆ天使ヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2015/12/16/7518926/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりに高みなさんと⭐︎⭐︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"偉大な方です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高みなさんみたいな人間になりたいなぁ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっと頑張らないとね！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へばなっ☆彡"}],"source":"archive"}